    "title": "Trump Demands UN Probe into 'Triple Sabotage' Against Him",
    "text": "\"A REAL DISGRACE took place at the United Nations yesterday — Not one, not two, but three very sinister events! ... This wasn’t a coincidence, this was triple sabotage at the UN. They ought to be ashamed of themselves. I’m sending a copy of this letter to the Secretary General, and I demand an immediate investigation. No wonder the United Nations hasn’t been able to do the job that they were put in existence to do,\" Trump wrote on Truth Social. Trump said that the elevator was turned off when he and First Lady Melania Trump were on it, a teleprompter was not working during his speech and the sound was off when he was delivering remarks. https://sputnikglobe.com/20250923/trump-questions-purpose-of-united-nations-in-unga-address-1122841579.html americas new york",
